guide forever/class/warlock/incubus-undercity
title Incubus (Undercity)
category Class
class Warlock
folder Warlock
faction Horde
levels 20-24
zone Undercity
keywords Summon Incubus, sayaad, Hearts of the Lovers, Avelina Lilly, Isaac Pearson, Ambermill, Ratchet, Devourer of Souls, Carendin Halgar, Godrick Farsan, The Binding, Warlock, class pet

# The incubus from the Undercity: Devourer of Souls (1472) from Carendin
# Halgar to Godrick Farsan, Hearts of the Lovers (65593: Avelina Lilly at
# Ambermill in Silverpine Forest, Isaac Pearson in Ratchet) and The Binding
# (65597) at Carendin's summoning circle.
# Sources: quests.json, npcs.json and items.json (Questie 12.1.0 and
# Questie-Forever) for the givers, the two hearts and their owners; Wowhead
# Forever's Warlock class page (data/local/quest-audit/wowhead-class-quests.json):
# Forever gives the chain level 20 and lists a Small Soul Pouch as The
# Binding's reward. Forever's data does not list the spell; Wowpedia
# ("Incubus (warlock minion)", Classic-only, not confirmed in Forever)
# describes the incubus as the male sayaad, the succubus's counterpart.
# Carendin's Devourer of Souls and Gan'rul Bloodeye's in Orgrimmar exclude
# each other: this guide is for warlocks who took Carendin's. The Horde
# leveling guides take Gan'rul's (forever/horde/04-the-barrens, the
# succubus); those warlocks follow forever/class/warlock/incubus-orgrimmar.
# Left out: Carendin's succubus, Hearts of the Pure (1476, 1474): Forever
# replaced its second heart with Corma's Heart, which the data cannot place.

step Devourer of Souls
  tip At 20 Carendin Halgar, in the Magic Quarter, sends you to Godrick Farsan in the Temple of the Damned, just north of him.
  level 20
  accept 1472                         -- Carendin Halgar
  turnin 1472                         -- Godrick Farsan
  accept 65593

step Avelina Lilly
  zone Silverpine Forest
  tip Avelina Lilly works as a tailor for the Dalaran wizards at Ambermill, in eastern Silverpine Forest. Take her heart.
  collect 190179                      -- Avelina's Heart

step Isaac Pearson
  zone The Barrens
  tip Isaac Pearson works in Ratchet, on the Barrens coast. Take the zeppelin to Durotar and ride or fly on to Ratchet.
  collect 190180 quest 65593.1        -- Isaac's Heart

step The Binding
  zone Undercity
  tip Back to Carendin in the Magic Quarter. Place the hearts at the summoning circle below him and defeat the incubus they call.
  turnin 65593                        -- Carendin Halgar
  accept 65597
  kill 185335 quest 65597.1           -- Summoned Incubus
  turnin 65597                        -- Carendin Halgar: he binds the incubus to you
